   876	### 15.1 Container [OWNER 2026-10-14, G14, G17, G33]
   877	
   878	A bundle is one UTF-8 JSON text that passes ENC §1.4 checks 1–5 and 7 and is canonical JCS. It contains no JSON
   879	numbers. Heights and durations are decimal strings matching `0|[1-9][0-9]*` with value at most 4294967295. Binary
   880	values are RFC 4648 §4 base64 with padding that round-trips (no non-zero pad bits, no line breaks). Size cap 2^27
   881	bytes. Top level: exactly `{"layers":[L],"profile":"tessera-v1-strict"}`. After dispatch (section 3.1): a
