   981	| `version` | decimal string ≥ 1 | prior + 1 |
   982	| `previous_sha256` | 64 lowercase hex | 64 zeros for version 1; else the prior config's hash |
   983	| `as_of` | RFC 3339 `YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SSZ` | nondecreasing |
   984	| `issuer_domain` | `"wamason.com"` | equals D |
