   986	| `root_ksks` | array of KSK entries, sorted by (`signing_start`, `key_tag`) | unique `dnskey_rdata` |
   987	| `repository_keys` | array of `{"domain","key","signing_end","signing_start","sources"}` | `domain` = D; `key` base64 v4 P-256 body; `signing_end` nullable; start ≤ end; unique `key` |
   988	
   989	KSK entry (strings unless marked):
   990	
   991	| Field | Type | Invariant |
   992	|---|---|---|
   993	| `name` | e.g. `"KSK-2017"` | unique |
   994	| `key_tag` | decimal string 0–65535 | equals RFC 4034 App. B tag of `dnskey_rdata` |
   995	| `algorithm` | decimal string | equals the RDATA algorithm; in {8, 13} |
   996	| `dnskey_rdata` | base64 of RFC 4034 §2.2 RDATA | flags 257, REVOKE clear, protocol 3 |
   997	| `ds_sha256` | 64 lowercase hex | SHA-256 over root owner wire `00` ‖ RDATA |
   998	| `signing_start`, `signing_end` | RFC 3339; `signing_end` nullable | start ≤ end |
   999	| `reliance_lifetime_s` (L) | decimal string | immutable |
  1000	| `publication`, `revocation` | RFC 3339 or null | informational |
  1001	| `sources` | nonempty array of `{"description","sha256","uri"}` | `sha256` of the archived source |
