  1003	### 15.6 Dependency manifest [OWNER 2026-10-14, G15]
  1004	
  1005	A closed JCS object, exactly `{"entries":[…],"format":"tessera-v1-deps/1"}`; `entries` sorted by `id`, unique. Each
  1006	entry has all of: `id` (`[a-z0-9-]+`), `title`, `edition`, `sections` (nonempty array of strings), `errata`,
  1007	`digest_sha256` (64 lowercase hex, or null where no canonical bytes exist), `retrieval`, `redistribution`,
  1008	`failure_consequence`; strings unless marked. The entry list is section 9's.
