   189	Rows i and i′ are an owner addition after Decision C; they add no false reject. *Registered prediction:* a
   190	headline-only reader fails e and f; i′ is the same hazard and is in the test. The test measures whether the
   191	documentation prevents that. The E10 vectors test the verifier, not comprehension.
