   193	## A9.2 The Band 0 gate, re-scoped to V1's claims — OWNER DECISION (Q1)
   194	
   195	- **Code rule: one gate.** *"Before any code"* (`phase-0-prereg.md:102`, author clarification 2026-08-29: code
   196	  intended for the service) is replaced by: **no V1 issuer or verifier code is written before the whole 30 Oct exit
   197	  is recorded.** There is no per-claim gate.
