   194	## 2. The tagged byte strings: one header, four tags
   195	
   196	Every V1 byte string that a V1 key signs or that OTS stamps begins with the same header:
   197	
   198	```
   199	header(t) = u8 len(t) || t                       t ∈ T (ASCII, no NUL)
   200	```
   201	
   202	| Tag `t` | len | First bytes (hex) | Construction |
   203	|---|---|---|---|
   204	| `tessera-v1/attest` | 17 | `11 74 65 73 …` | frame, §3 |
   205	| `tessera-v1/manifest` | 19 | `13 74 65 73 …` | frame, §4 |
   206	| `tessera-v1/receipt-anchor-sig` | 29 | `1d 74 65 73 …` | signature-inclusive anchor preimage `A_sig`, §5 |
   207	| `tessera-v1/dnssec-snapshot` | 26 | `1a 74 65 73 …` | snapshot preimage, §6 |
