   802	- the bundle's container format and transport encoding (G-26);
   803	- where the observed anchor delay is recorded (G-40);
   804	- the snapshot body's format;
   805	- the git blob path;
   806	- the signature verification profile (P3 [assumption]). P8 now fixes each signature's *serialization* and its
